  "body": "<!-- lyrictile-managed-engineering-draft-v1 -->\n# LyricTile 1.0.0 · build 49\n\n**UNSIGNED ENGINEERING DRAFT · 未公开的工程候选**\n\nThese are the original ad-hoc CI packages, without Developer ID signing or Apple notarization. This draft is release preparation, not the signed consumer release.\n\n- Source: `b95b6f5ed7680cbde1427a4ed1a904bd5875e17b`\n- Native CI: https://github.com/haohongfei2001-png/nearpane/actions/runs/46024615269\n- Artifact: `LyricTile-candidate-49`\n- Platform: Apple silicon, macOS 27+\n- Apple Music result in this run: **PASS**; inspect the original report for scope.\n\n`SHA256SUMS` covers the unchanged candidate ZIP/DMG. `candidate-verification.json` records asset hashes and evidence boundaries. The verification ZIP preserves original native screenshots and small CI reports; authored fixtures, live network probes, and actual player observations remain distinct. No all-player, commercial-catalog, word-timing, or new eight-hour qualification is implied.\n\n待本机使用现有凭据对同一源码完成签名、公证和必要的升级验证后，再建立独立正式 Release。此草稿不会更新公开下载入口或自动更新 feed；旧 build 4 不代表本候选。\n"
